WEBVTT

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.760
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.000
(SINGING CONTINUES)

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.200
My first evil lair! Goose bumps!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.960
(EXPLOSION)

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.080
(CHANT MINIONESE)

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.120
Well, you've got to break a few eggs
to make an omelette.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.560
Am I right?

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.600
Oh, great job, Ryan.
(SHUDDERS)

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.840
I said, great job!
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GROANING)

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.480
Never mind!

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.160
Adrien! Mack! Looking good!

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.720
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.280
(SOBS)

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.360
Joe! How's the family?

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.200
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GIGGLES)

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.880
OK, everybody, get over here!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.280
(SHUDDERS)

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.800
Now listen up. Buckle your overalls.
Hold on to your goggles.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.920
The Vicious Six wants to meet me!
Tomorrow!

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.880
(LAUGHS)
(CHEERING)

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.640
CHANTING: Mini-Boss!
Mini-Boss! Mini-Boss!

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.600
All right, all right. I'm not mini.
Please stop calling me that.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.760
And also,
they haven't accepted me yet.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.320
(GROAN) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.360
Hello, Otto. What is it?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.600
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:13.440
(SIGHS)
Blah, blah, blah.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:16.920
Uh-huh. Well... Tha... That... Oh.
Yes, I w...

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.800
(SPEAKS MINIONESE QUICKLY)
Mm-hmm?

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.840
I would... Oh, OK!
You know what would be fun?

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:25.000
Let's play the quiet game.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.800
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
(LOW CHATTER IN MINIONESE)

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:31.200
Anyway, thanks for the hard work
today everyone.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.800
I got to go get some rest.

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.400
Tomorrow is the biggest day
of my life!

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.600
(CHEERS)
Watch out, world! Here comes Gru!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.560
(LAUGHTER) (CHEER)

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.680
Mini-Boss! Mini-Boss!
I'm not... (GROANS)

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.440
Mini-Boss...
(LIFT WHIRS)

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.000
Oh-ho!
(SIGHS) (GRUNTS)

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:52.040
(LIGHT CLICKS)

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.680
(TORCH CLICKS)

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:01.360
Oh, these guys are the best.
I can't believe it!

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.480
(WHIMPERS)

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.160
Uh, Mini-boss?
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.200
Ugh! Yeah, I get it,
but I need a good night's sleep,

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.240
so get out.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:15.640
(GROANS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.000
OK, fine, fine.
Because you had a nightmare.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.520
But just tonight.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.320
(CHUCKLES) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.640
I'm not buying the nightmare story,
though.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:33.440
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.400
Oh, really? You too?
Uh-hm.

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:38.480
Get in.
(GIGGLES)

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.720
MINIONS: Good night.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.160
Yes, yes, yes. Good night.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.360
(YELLS)
OH!

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.480
(SIGHS)

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.120
(GROANS)
I just want to get some sleep.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:53.160
# VNC #

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.240
Breaking news,

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:58.400
the Vicious Six is ready
to rewrite the rules of villainy!

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.400
Villains of the world,
in three days,

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:06.120
when the clock strikes midnight
and the Chinese New Year begins,

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.400
this bad boy's power
is gonna be unleashed.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:12.000
With the power of the Zodiac,

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.960
we're gonna take out
the Anti-Villain League.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.840
(EXPLOSIONS)

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:21.680
And the Vicious Six will be the most
powerful villains on the planet!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.680
Can you dig it?

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.800
(THUD, CLATTER)

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.960
Do I dig it? Do I dig it?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.320
I don't dig it!
There's nothing to dig!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.200
They thought
they could leave me for dead, huh?

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:34.680
Kick me to the curb
like a piece of old meat?

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:38.480
Oh, they got no idea what's coming.
(LAUGHS)

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:41.800
Oh, I'm gonna make them suffer
for what they've done to me.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.560
Oh, boy.
Hey, Mr Knuckles!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.600
What?

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.640
We, uh, just wanted to make sure
we'd be getting paid this week.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.880
What a mouth on you!
I'm paying you with knowledge.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:52.600
You are? Ow!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.720
Lesson one, always be prepared.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.120
Lesson two...
(GRUNTING)

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:01.200
..the Belgian five-armed nose pick.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.040
And lesson three...

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.560
the Lithuanian...
(FIGHTING YELL)

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.280
..haircut!
(SCREAMS)

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:11.000
(YELLING) (CLATTER)

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.040
(LAUGHS)

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.120
That's worth all the money
in the world.

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:16.680
Hey, guys, forget about it,
you're gonna get paid.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.200
But first,
we gotta get my stone back!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:25.040
# I see a bad Gru a-rising
(SCATS)

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.400
# I see a villain on his way

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.280
# Yee-haw!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:33.320
# I'm gonna interview with my heroes

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.240
(SCATS)

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:40.040
# They're gonna love me
'cause I'm the best (SCATS)

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.040
# Don't mess up tonight
(GRUNTS)

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.360
# You're gonna join the Vicious Six
Yeah! #

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:48.240
# There is a bad Gru
On the rise... #

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.880
Guys!
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.240
Oh, you want to come.

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.480
(SPEAK MINIONESE)

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.640
Right, right. OK.
(SIGHS)

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:01.240
When you guys tracked me down

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.760
and responded
to my "help wanted" ad...

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.600
(KNOCKS)
I was like...

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.160
"Who are these tiny tater tots?

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.760
And where did they
get so much denim?

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.000
(DOOR BANGS)

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.800
(MUFFLED MINIONESE)

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.840
And you just wouldn't quit.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.120
(MUFFLED MINIONESE CHATTER)

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.280
(SNEEZES LOUDLY)

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.360
(EXHALES)

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:36.480
(GROANS)
All right, I surrender! Come on in.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.400
(SPEAK MINIONESE)
(LAUGHTER, CHEERING)

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.040
Whoo-hoo!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.920
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:48.000
We've had some great times
since then, but the thing is,

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:51.040
the Vicious Six,
they're the big leagues.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.640
And... you guys are... great,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:00.240
and so...
the job you did on the lair...

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.360
A-plus!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.320
It's just, what I was thinking

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.360
is that there are a lot
of other villains in the world.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.400
You know?

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:12.240
Uh...
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.600
(GROANS)
Never mind.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.840
Look, I think
I just need to fly solo on this.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:20.200
See you later, alligators!

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:22.040
(STAMMERS)

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.240
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
Uh, Kevin? Kevin!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.920
(GROANS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.080
(GROANS)

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.600
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.680
(SPEAKS MINIONESE QUICKLY)
Uh... Ot... Otto...

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.760
(CONVERSE IN MINIONESE)

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.480
Whoo-hoo!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.280
(FAST-PACED, ACTION MUSIC)

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:51.920
Go, go, go!

